  "scope": "Mutually exclusive attribution of individual CPU sample events or allocation samples by nearest exact API/source-driver boundary ancestor. This is sampled contextual attribution, not API call counts, phase wall clocks or causal removable cost. Unassigned mass retained. Anonymous/common helpers and SCC dispatchers are never assigned by their own names. Exact-boundary ancestry may be absent due to inlining or asynchronous stacks.",
